# slice 2 of the receiver `table` (one rule for the translator's tables): a source that converts nothing
# (its whole body is the letter to the host) with no convert.lm2 beside it (harness Table = absent): read
# at the start as primitive.lm2 is, the missing table is refused once -- "convert.lm2: cannot read a table
# file of the translator" (read at the first pair, it was needed by no source that converts nothing).

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
